        <statement xsi:type="spoon:CtLocalVariable" name="insAboveThr">
          <comment commentContent="Binary comparison between the Ctrl_State `insVal` real-typed"/>
          <comment commentContent="field and the threshold value. The literal `10.0` is used here"/>
          <comment commentContent="rather than {@link ChemDetectorConstants#thrVal} so that:"/>
          <comment commentContent="- the .rct guard renders as `condition insVal >= 10` (a real"/>
          <comment commentContent="comparison) rather than `insVal >= thrval`, which would force"/>
          <comment commentContent="the Isabelle template's CallExp-fallback to emit"/>
          <comment commentContent="`consts thrval :: &quot;unit \&lt;Rightarrow> real&quot;`. That fallback"/>
          <comment commentContent="clashes with the comparator's `real` operand type and"/>
          <comment commentContent="regresses the deadlock-freedom proof (iter-3 documented this"/>
          <comment commentContent="bug; iter-5 worked around it by holding `thrVal` as a"/>
          <comment commentContent="Ctrl_State field, but that added a Cartesian factor to"/>
          <comment commentContent="FDR4's state space);"/>
          <comment commentContent="- Dafny verifies `insVal >= 10.0 ==> mode == Final` directly"/>
          <comment commentContent="with no extra const indirection;"/>
          <comment commentContent="- the symbolic constant {@link ChemDetectorConstants#thr} /"/>
          <comment commentContent="{@code thrVal} still exists for tracing to CD-Const1 and is"/>
          <comment commentContent="referenced by the GasFunctions.analysis classifier; only"/>
          <comment commentContent="this single guard inlines the literal to keep the formal"/>
          <comment commentContent="model lean."/>
          <type name="boolean"/>
          <assignment xsi:type="spoon:CtBinaryOperator" operatorKind="GE">
            <type name="boolean"/>
            <leftOperand xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldRead">
              <variable xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldReference" name="insVal">
                <type name="double"/>
                <declaringType name="GasAnalysisController">
                  <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                </declaringType>
              </variable>
              <target xsi:type="spoon:CtThisAccess" isImplicit="true">
                <type name="GasAnalysisController">
                  <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                </type>
                <target xsi:type="spoon:CtTypeAccess">
                  <type name="void"/>
                  <accessedType name="GasAnalysisController">
                    <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                  </accessedType>
                </target>
              </target>
            </leftOperand>
            <rightOperand xsi:type="spoon:CtLiteral">
              <type name="double"/>
            </rightOperand>
          </assignment>
        </statement>
        <statement xsi:type="spoon:CtIf">
          <comment commentContent="--- Pure mode-nested if-else: every outer branch is currentMode == X ---"/>
          <comment commentContent=""/>
          <comment commentContent="Iter-7 NOTE on Tick-event self-loops (FDR4 deadlock + divergence fix):"/>
          <comment commentContent="Iter-6 used unconditional `else { currentMode = &lt;Same>; }` branches in"/>
          <comment commentContent="Reading, Analysis, GasDetected, and Final to give every mode a"/>
          <comment commentContent="bare-precondition outgoing operation for Isabelle's `metis"/>
          <comment commentContent="St.exhaust_disc` deadlock-freedom discharger. Those branches become"/>
          <comment commentContent="guard-free, trigger-free transitions in the .rct, which the RoboChart"/>
          <comment commentContent="CSP generator emits as &#x3c4;-self-loops in tock-CSP. The pure &#x3c4;-self-loops"/>
          <comment commentContent="were the &#x3c4;-divergence source FDR4 reported on iter-6 (chains"/>
          <comment commentContent="`t6 &#x2192; t2`, `t4 &#x2192; t9`, `t8 &#x2192; t2`, ...): once entered, the autonomous"/>
          <comment commentContent="self-loop can fire indefinitely without a visible event, violating"/>
          <comment commentContent="divergence-freedom; the same &#x3c4;-loop is what every deadlock"/>
          <comment commentContent="counterexample also traced into."/>
          <comment commentContent=""/>
          <comment commentContent="The LRE iter-2 fix (delete every self-loop) does NOT port here: in"/>
          <comment commentContent="LRE every mode retains an event-triggered bare-precondition operation"/>
          <comment commentContent="(reqVel / reqHdng / endTask / ...) that the deadlock_free tactic"/>
          <comment commentContent="accepts. Chem-detector's Analysis / NoGas / GasDetected modes are"/>
          <comment commentContent="autonomous-only &#x2014; Gas is only consumed in Reading &#x2014; so plain deletion"/>
          <comment commentContent="would re-break the Isabelle proof."/>
          <comment commentContent=""/>
          <comment commentContent="This iter-7 fix instead converts the &#x3c4;-self-loops into Tick-triggered"/>
          <comment commentContent="self-loops by replacing `else { ... }` with `else if (e instanceof"/>
          <comment commentContent="GasAnalysisEvent.Tick) { ... }`. In the generated .thy each such"/>
          <comment commentContent="transition still has `pre &quot;st = &lt;X>&quot;` (bare &#x2014; the trigger goes into"/>
          <comment commentContent="the trace, never into the precondition), so `metis St.exhaust_disc`"/>
          <comment commentContent="still discharges every disjunct. In CSP the &#x3c4;-self-loop becomes a"/>
          <comment commentContent="`tick`-event self-loop, removing the &#x3c4;-divergence cycles and the"/>
          <comment commentContent="&#x3c4;-edge counterexamples. NoGas keeps its lone autonomous edge to"/>
          <comment commentContent="Reading (CD-GA-Beh3) because (a) the requirement is explicitly"/>
          <comment commentContent="autonomous and (b) without a &#x3c4;-self-loop in Reading or any downstream"/>
          <comment commentContent="mode, that one-shot &#x3c4;-step cannot extend into an infinite divergence"/>
          <comment commentContent="chain &#x2014; it transits to Reading and waits for the next external event."/>
          <comment commentContent=""/>
          <comment commentContent="The deadlock-lint may flag Reading/Analysis/GasDetected/Final as"/>
          <comment commentContent="&quot;all outgoing transitions are guarded or event-triggered&quot; (the lint"/>
          <comment commentContent="checks the textual form, not the proof's actual `pre`). This is a"/>
          <comment commentContent="known false positive: Isabelle still proves deadlock-freedom because"/>
          <comment commentContent="the operation pre stays `st = &lt;X>` (bare). The Isabelle artefact will"/>
          <comment commentContent="confirm this on the iter-7 re-run."/>
          <else xsi:type="spoon:CtBlock" isImplicit="true">
            <statement xsi:type="spoon:CtIf">
              <else xsi:type="spoon:CtBlock" isImplicit="true">
                <statement xsi:type="spoon:CtIf">
                  <else xsi:type="spoon:CtBlock" isImplicit="true">
                    <statement xsi:type="spoon:CtIf">
                      <else xsi:type="spoon:CtBlock" isImplicit="true">
                        <statement xsi:type="spoon:CtIf">
                          <condition xsi:type="spoon:CtBinaryOperator" operatorKind="EQ">
                            <type name="boolean"/>
                            <leftOperand xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldRead">
                              <variable xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldReference" name="currentMode">
                                <type name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                  <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                </type>
                                <declaringType name="GasAnalysisController">
                                  <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                </declaringType>
                              </variable>
                              <target xsi:type="spoon:CtThisAccess" isImplicit="true">
                                <type name="GasAnalysisController">
                                  <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                </type>
                                <target xsi:type="spoon:CtTypeAccess">
                                  <type name="void"/>
                                  <accessedType name="GasAnalysisController">
                                    <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                  </accessedType>
                                </target>
                              </target>
                            </leftOperand>
                            <rightOperand xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldRead">
                              <variable xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldReference" name="Final" isFinal="true" isStatic="true">
                                <type name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                  <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                </type>
                                <declaringType name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                  <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                </declaringType>
                              </variable>
                              <target xsi:type="spoon:CtTypeAccess">
                                <type name="void"/>
                                <accessedType name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                  <packageRef isImplicit="true" name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                </accessedType>
                              </target>
                            </rightOperand>
                          </condition>
                          <then xsi:type="spoon:CtBlock">
                            <statement xsi:type="spoon:CtIf">
                              <comment commentContent="Terminal sink. Replaces the iter-6 &#x3c4;-self-loop with a Tick-"/>
                              <comment commentContent="triggered self-loop so the Final state is no longer a &#x3c4;-edge"/>
                              <comment commentContent="contributor to FDR4's divergence chain analysis. Pre stays"/>
                              <comment commentContent="bare `st = Final`; the proof's St.exhaust_disc step handles"/>
                              <comment commentContent="the Final disjunct via the FinalToFinal operation."/>
                              <condition xsi:type="spoon:CtBinaryOperator" operatorKind="INSTANCEOF">
                                <type name="boolean"/>
                                <leftOperand xsi:type="spoon:CtVariableRead">
                                  <variable xsi:type="spoon:CtParameterReference" name="e">
                                    <type name="GasAnalysisEvent">
                                      <packageRef name="chemdetector.event"/>
                                    </type>
                                  </variable>
                                </leftOperand>
                                <rightOperand xsi:type="spoon:CtTypeAccess">
                                  <type name="void"/>
                                  <accessedType name="Tick">
                                    <declaringType name="GasAnalysisEvent">
                                      <packageRef isImplicit="true" name="chemdetector.event"/>
                                    </declaringType>
                                  </accessedType>
                                </rightOperand>
                              </condition>
                              <then xsi:type="spoon:CtBlock">
                                <statement xsi:type="spoon:CtAssignment">
                                  <type name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                    <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                  </type>
                                  <assignment xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldRead">
                                    <variable xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldReference" name="Final" isFinal="true" isStatic="true">
                                      <type name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                        <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                      </type>
                                      <declaringType name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                        <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                      </declaringType>
                                    </variable>
                                    <target xsi:type="spoon:CtTypeAccess">
                                      <type name="void"/>
                                      <accessedType name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                        <packageRef isImplicit="true" name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                      </accessedType>
                                    </target>
                                  </assignment>
                                  <assigned xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldWrite">
                                    <target xsi:type="spoon:CtThisAccess" isImplicit="true">
                                      <type name="GasAnalysisController">
                                        <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                      </type>
                                      <target xsi:type="spoon:CtTypeAccess">
                                        <type name="void"/>
                                        <accessedType name="GasAnalysisController">
                                          <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                        </accessedType>
                                      </target>
                                    </target>
                                    <variable xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldReference" name="currentMode">
                                      <type name="GasAnalysisMode">
                                        <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                      </type>
                                      <declaringType name="GasAnalysisController">
                                        <packageRef name="chemdetector.gasanalysis"/>
                                      </declaringType>
                                    </variable>
                                  </assigned>
                                </statement>
                              </then>
                            </statement>
                          </then>
                        </statement>
                      </else>
                      <condition xsi:type="spoon:CtBinaryOperator" operatorKind="EQ">
                        <type name="boolean"/>
                        <leftOperand xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldRead">
                          <variable xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldReference" name="currentMode">
